{"diagnosis": "TRAP stays asserted (TRAP: cpu trap asserted, tohost FAIL 0xdead, CYCLES=2009) instead of low during NOP fetch progress. Expected trap deasserted while launch_next_insn fetches NOPs. Root cause is line 1403 `trap <= 1;` unconditionally re-asserting trap each posedge clk, so trap can never clear.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1402,6 +1402,6 @@
 	always @(posedge clk) begin
-		trap <= 1;
+		trap <= 0;
 		reg_sh <= 'bx;
 		reg_out <= 'bx;
 		set_mem_do_rinst = 0;
 		set_mem_do_rdata = 0;
", "expected": "tohost PASS with trap deasserted and fetch progress, checksum changes from c2a7a4d6295484feeb9ec1ea9381732b8e39a7ccd1997c7d70f6454da2fb4659, no TRAP: cpu trap asserted"}

